  [CommRing 𝕜] [TopologicalSpace 𝕜] [IsTopologicalRing 𝕜] [ConditionallyCompleteLinearOrder 𝕜] [OrderTopology 𝕜]
  [AddCommGroup E] [TopologicalSpace E] [Module 𝕜 E] [IsModuleTopology 𝕜 E]
